rovacomd is a Rust port of novacomd, the daemon of the novacom toolset for
communicating with webOS devices over USB:

  https://github.com/openwebos/novacomd
  Reference baseline: upstream HEAD 530a10378af854fc0723b14f3f807d26a028070d
  (the exact ported commit is recorded in this repository's assessment)

